===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|vrosch}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|frosc||frog}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*fruskaz||frog}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*prew-||jump, hop}}. Cognate with {{cog|gml|vorsch||frog}}, Dutch {{m|nl|vors}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|froask}}, Icelandic {{m|is|froskur}}, English {{m|en|frosh||frog}}. More at {{l|en|frosh}}.

